{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40517","headline":"雉兔者 · 苏拯","name":"雉兔者","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"所猎一何酷，终年耗林麓。\n飞走如未空，贪残岂知足。\n尝闻猎书史，可以鉴荣辱。\n尝闻猎贤良，可以霸邦国。\n如何纵网罗，空成肥骨肉。\n和济俱不闻，曷所禳颠覆。\n谁能爲扣天地鑪，铸此伤生其可乎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"苏拯","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40517.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40517","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}